Pull request #1290 "auth: absolute session lifetime" (IDLE_TIMEOUT_MS = 14 days, ABSOLUTE_LIFETIME_MS = 30 days), inside refresh() after the revoked and used checks; row is the presented token:

+  const familyDeadline = row.createdAt + ABSOLUTE_LIFETIME_MS;
+  if (now >= familyDeadline) return { ok: false, reason: "family_expired" };
   if (now >= row.expiresAt) return { ok: false, reason: "idle_timeout" };
   const next = await this.tokens.insert({
     familyId: row.familyId, userId: row.userId, deviceId: row.deviceId,
     tokenHash: sha256Hex(newToken), createdAt: now,
-    expiresAt: now + IDLE_TIMEOUT_MS,
+    expiresAt: Math.min(now + IDLE_TIMEOUT_MS, familyDeadline),
   });

Statement: "After this change, a client that refreshes every 6 days must sign in again at the latest 30 days after its login."
